the realm  do you know what the realm is  it's the thousand blades of aegon's  enemies  a story we agreed to tell each other  over  and over till we forget that it's a lie  what's up ladies and gentlemen welcome  back for another game of thrones and a  song of ice and fire update video well  my friends it looks like we now have  confirmation from our beloved mother of  dragons according to emilia clarke she  says kit harrington is in fact working  on a jon snow sequel series with hbo  now for those of you who haven't heard  about this yet james hibbard who writes  for the hollywood reporter released an  article stating mr harrington was in the  works on a jon snow sequel series at hbo  this new jon snow series would show us  what is happening with jon snow after  the events of game of thrones when we  saw him ghost and the small group of  wildlings head north of the wall at the  end of season 8. hbo still hasn't  confirmed this themselves however amelia  has now given us a confirmation because  she said kit harrington has told her  about this himself let me show you  exactly what was said during emilia's  new interview in the new article written  by the bbc it says amelia will be  watching the new game of thrones  successor show house of the dragon i'm  going to watch this as a fresh viewer  because it's set a bajillion years  before our show so it will feel  different and in response to a story in  the hollywood reporter that kid  harrington will renew his role as jon  snow in a game of thrones sequel amelia  says he has told me about it and i know  it exists it's happening it's been  created by kid as far as i can  understand so he's in it from the ground  up so what you will be watching  hopefully if it happens is certified by  kid harrington himself well there you  have it ladies and gentlemen maybe you  don't believe james hibbard when he says  this will happen but i find it hard not  to believe amelia clarke because as we  all know she knows kid harrington very  well i just don't see her saying  something like this unless it were real  she sounds very confident in the fact  that not only is it happening but kit  harrington is helping create it from the  ground up  now like i already said before just  because he might be working on this show  with hbo doesn't mean it will ever see  the light of day this certainly would  not be the first time hbo developed the  game of thrones successor show that  never actually released now this doesn't  mean kid harrington will be writing or  even directing anything either that's  not to say he can't or won't but saying  he is working on the show from the  ground up most likely means he is  helping develop it maybe he's giving  them some ideas for its direction  game of thrones writers dan and dave  will not be working on the show either i  feel like i need to say that because for  some reason fans always ask if they are  involved with the game of thrones  successor shows well i'm here to say  they are not dan and dave no longer work  for hbo they haven't worked there for  years with that being said i did have a  feeling something like this would  eventually happen i have been saying it  for months now in several of my videos i  have said i would bet a number of game  of thrones actors would be willing to  come back for another show once they had  several years to see what their other  options are outside of game of thrones  now that game of thrones has been off  the air for several years some of them  most likely miss working on one of the  biggest shows in the history of  television some of them most likely miss  being seen as one of the most  recognizable characters on any format  when game of thrones ended a lot of them  were burned out from the decade-long  grind but now they've had three years  off  now they have seen what other roles they  are being offered and unfortunately for  some of them they will never work on  something this big ever again  not all of them of course but you know  it will be accurate for most this show  will focus on jon snow because he is  obviously the most recognizable  character who is still alive in this  story however that doesn't mean other  characters from game of thrones can't  show back up either i know some of you  already think this show will only be  about jon snow but if this does actually  happen and fans do show up for it i  guarantee hbo will do everything they  can to get some of the other actors back  you have to remember hbo did not want  game of thrones to end they offered dan  and dave a lot more money to keep things  going but they wanted it to be over so  they could work on other things well hbo  didn't they want to keep this gravy  train moving right along which is why  they keep developing all these other  shows in the song of ice and fire  universe we all know they have to go up  against netflix amazon disney and many  others believe me when i say this hbo  wants game of thrones back on our  screens as bad as season 8 was it was  their most successful season ever the  ratings were still through the roof no  matter how bad the fans reacted to it  they wanted a game of thrones season 9  and beyond whether anyone else wants to  admit that or not that is what they  wanted and i believe it's what they  still want because that is what will be  the most successful out of any of the  other show ideas they have in mind i  mean sure game of thrones is over they  no longer have george rr martin's novels  to follow and sure a lot of the actors  will never want to come back but do you  actually think that means hbo will stop  if they think they can make something  work as in make something that will make  them money  i don't think so they already unloaded  30 million dollars into a long night  show that was never released then they  moved right onto another show and gave  it a full series order without even  seeing a single second of the footage  you should see that as a hint  they want game of thrones in some shape  or form back on the air it is a billion  dollar franchise and they still have  millions of fans who want to see it  whether you me or other hardcore fans  think it's a good idea or not they don't  want a jon snow movie they want a jon  snow series that will hopefully open up  the door for some of the other  characters from the original series to  come back to bring in even more of the  fans  now i will admit i very well could be  wrong about all of this however this is  what i believe  as some of you may remember i've been  saying this even before maisie williams  flirted with the idea of making another  show  as we get further and further away from  the ending of game of thrones and more  and more the actors realize they will  never work on something like this again  they will wish they were back on that  set still making the biggest and most  successful show ever made  they might have been burned out after a  decade of making this show i don't doubt  that but after several years of falling  off the radar who wouldn't want to come  back and instantly step into a  recognizable role that also happens to  come with massive amounts of money at  least for a handful of them  again maybe i am wrong maybe none of  this will actually ever happen  i guess we will just have to wait and  see  now during emilia's new interview she  also said she thinks she is done with  game of thrones meaning she doesn't  think she will ever sign on for another  show  as much as i know some of you want to  see that maybe it is for the best  because it would obviously be really  difficult for them to do anything with  their story even if they did resurrect  her  as i have stated before i would be open  to daenerys coming back depending on how  they did it and what they did with their  character afterwards i don't even really  want to get into all that until we know  more about this jon snow sequel series  this would obviously have to move  forward first before we could even  really consider something like that  i will never say never though because i  do think hbo would consider it  themselves if they had a great idea for  it as of right now though let's just see  what else happens with the jon snow show  let's see if any more interesting  information is announced in the  following days or weeks as we lead up to  house of the dragon  make sure you do subscribe so you can  stay up to date on any and all news and  updates regarding game of thrones their  successor shows and the ones of winter  as always i want to thank all of you for  watching the video  i hope all of you have a great day i  will see you again very soon  bye  [Music]  [Music]  so  you

